        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 6430, Linstead Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to be easily gripped and held, the DoralLock 6430 Linstead Lever is a stylish lever. This leverset has a modern appearance that makes it a great choice from contemporary style homes. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. And since this lever is available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions, you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of DoralLock Linstead Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install, this lever fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is ANSI rated grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is 5 pin Kwikset compatible keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed, field reversible lever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Linstead Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-6430-specifications.pdf?v=1704262175\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock 6430 Linstead Lever Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.  Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a finger turn located in the middle of the lever. In an emergency, it can unlock from the exterior using a coin or a screwdriver. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a finger turn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
